WEBVTT

00:00:02.458 --> 00:00:04.848
TAKE A LOOK ON MY FACE HOW I LOOKING.

00:00:15.098 --> 00:00:16.174
NOVEMBER

00:00:16.174 --> 00:00:18.484
TWENTY SECOND, NINETEEN NINETY SIX.

00:00:18.484 --> 00:00:21.164
THE SURVIVOR IS NAFTALY LINKOVSKY.

00:00:21.164 --> 00:00:23.244
THE INTERVIEWER IS FAY NICOLL.

00:00:23.244 --> 00:00:24.884
TAPE THREE.

00:00:26.016 --> 00:00:29.300
mir hobn opgehaltn bay di ende fun di milkhome.

00:00:30.117 --> 00:00:32.062
nayntsn finef un fertsik

00:00:32.062 --> 00:00:36.641
un ir zent geven nokh in di militer biz nayntsn zeks un fertsik

00:00:36.748 --> 00:00:40.184
zent ir a- vos hot ir getun in nayntsn zeks fertsik?

00:00:40.478 --> 00:00:43.308
nayntsn zeks un fertsik hot men mikh demobilizirt

00:00:43.308 --> 00:00:46.748
hob ikh gebetn me zol mir demobilizirn keyn Tshernovits

00:00:46.748 --> 00:00:48.868
vayl aheymforndik aheym

00:00:48.868 --> 00:00:53.208
bin ikh durkhgeforn durkh mayn shtetl, hob ikh nisht getrofn nisht di shtub.

00:00:53.877 --> 00:00:56.891
dos gesl iz afile gevezn DESTROYED.

00:00:57.218 --> 00:00:58.849
nisht di mamen

00:00:58.905 --> 00:01:00.553
nisht si shvester

00:01:00.829 --> 00:01:04.184
keynem fun mayn mishpokhe. akegn undz hot gevoynt mayner a feter

00:01:04.184 --> 00:01:05.568
mit zayn mishpokhe

00:01:05.568 --> 00:01:07.893
keyner UNK. ale zenen umgekumen

00:01:08.136 --> 00:01:12.433
un di shtub iz gevezn opgevisht nor glaykh tsu di FLOOR

00:01:12.591 --> 00:01:14.098
tsu di GROUND FLOOR.

00:01:14.098 --> 00:01:18.199
dos ON- eyntsike vos ikh hob gekent derkenen vu dos plats iz gevezn

00:01:18.199 --> 00:01:21.124
iz gevezn tsebrokhene tep erdene

00:01:21.957 --> 00:01:23.318
vos mayne

00:01:23.425 --> 00:01:24.930
undzere hindelekh

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.960
flegn in, bay undz in hoyf arumgeyn esn

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:31.390
fun, un trinken fun di dozike CSEREPES.

00:01:31.474 --> 00:01:35.082
dos hot mir gelozt visn az do iz gevezn a mol

00:01:35.082 --> 00:01:37.478
mayn tatn's heym un mayn heym.

00:01:37.478 --> 00:01:38.134
mayn.

00:01:37.971 --> 00:01:39.686
vos hot ir demolts getun?

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:41.779
damolst bin ikh gegangen oyfn besoylem.

00:01:42.038 --> 00:01:44.869
tsu zen vu mayn tatn's keyver iz

00:01:44.869 --> 00:01:48.410
nor d- fir teg far der milkhome hobn mir nisht gehat keyn

00:01:48.417 --> 00:01:51.027
keyn miglekhkeyt tsu shteln im a matseyve.

00:01:51.027 --> 00:01:53.207
nor ikh hob gevust lebn vemen

00:01:53.327 --> 00:01:55.869
er iz gelign, lebn Mordkhe SHEYNDLMAN

00:01:55.892 --> 00:02:01.230
iz Mordkhe SHEYNDLEMAN's matseyve iz shoyn oykh nit geven. ales iz geven DESTROYED, un ikh hob nisht gefunen

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:03.243
mayn tatn's mits- matseyve.

00:02:03.317 --> 00:02:06.908
hob ikh gefregt Shaye Shoykhet, dem vos ikh hob frier dermant

00:02:06.908 --> 00:02:08.824
vos ikh bin gangen mit im tsuzamen

00:02:08.824 --> 00:02:11.684
in, in, in der yeshive

00:02:11.684 --> 00:02:16.174
hot er gezogt "zolst g- az d'vest geboyrn a kind, zolst a nomen gebn oyf dayn tatn.

00:02:16.174 --> 00:02:17.857
dos vet zayn di matseyve."

00:02:17.863 --> 00:02:20.000
un bay mir iz do a zun Shmuel.

00:02:21.019 --> 00:02:23.915
vos hot pasirt tsu ayere brider?

00:02:24.529 --> 00:02:27.763
tsu mayn eltern bruder, UNFORTUNATELY

00:02:28.545 --> 00:02:30.474
zeyer a ⟨talantfuler⟩ bruder

00:02:30.474 --> 00:02:31.981
a zinger.

00:02:32.241 --> 00:02:35.846
in zayn repertuar iz geven fir hundert ⟨PESN⟩, iz, lider.

00:02:36.257 --> 00:02:39.187
zayn froy hot gezungen khazones, un s'iz g-

00:02:40.206 --> 00:02:42.444
un zey hobn beyde gegibn kontsertn.

00:02:43.142 --> 00:02:46.902
aleyn iz er geven fun der profesye iz er gevezn in di ⟨for⟩ BUSINESS

00:02:46.902 --> 00:02:48.691
un iz geven a tsushnayder

00:02:48.691 --> 00:02:50.409
a mener tsushnayder.

00:02:50.297 --> 00:02:52.569
vos hot pasirt tsu ayer bruder?

00:02:51.597 --> 00:02:55.556
vos hot im bash- pasirt fun im? m'hot zey aroysgetribn fun Britsheve.

00:02:55.613 --> 00:02:58.875
Britsheve iz geven a kleyn shtetl fun tsvey mit a halbn gasn.

00:02:58.875 --> 00:02:59.910
yidish.

00:03:01.013 --> 00:03:05.532
lebn di Britsheve iz gevezn zibn kilometer iz gevezn a stantsye TIRNOVA.

00:03:05.532 --> 00:03:09.084
m'hot zey fartribn keyn TIRNOVA. fun TIRNOVA hot men zey farfirt

00:03:09.084 --> 00:03:11.092
in, keyn

00:03:11.092 --> 00:03:12.836
oyf, keyn

00:03:13.112 --> 00:03:16.244
oyfn, oyfn veg keyn Ades.

00:03:16.656 --> 00:03:17.783
keyn Ades.

00:03:17.783 --> 00:03:19.766
oyfn veg hot men tseteylt.

00:03:19.766 --> 00:03:23.411
er hot farloyrn dos vayb. dos vayb iz gegangen in a andere

00:03:23.411 --> 00:03:24.499
marsh

00:03:24.499 --> 00:03:28.816
un im, er mitn kind hot bavizn tsu geyn in a andern marsh.

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:33.441
ven s'iz gekumen di sovetn, iz er gevezn aktiv

00:03:33.565 --> 00:03:35.078
bay di sovetn

00:03:35.758 --> 00:03:40.809
az er, m'hot im gebetn az er zol dortn epes tun, er zol dortn

00:03:40.809 --> 00:03:46.673
 he- helfn zey ge-, ophitn di ge- di gesheftn, me zol nit rabeven

00:03:46.673 --> 00:03:50.551
iz gevezn, yeder shokhn hot gehat a nakht a SHMIRA

00:03:50.608 --> 00:03:54.157
un er iz oykhet geven tsulib der, tsulib der UNK iz dos gevezn

00:03:54.157 --> 00:03:56.340
hobn zey im, hot men bay im

00:03:56.616 --> 00:03:58.770
hot men im arestirt di zhandarm

00:03:58.877 --> 00:04:02.178
ven er iz g- ongekumen keyn PERVOMAYSK

00:04:02.438 --> 00:04:04.221
dos iz hinter Ades

00:04:04.311 --> 00:04:05.160
a fuf-

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:06.549
fuftsn kilometer.

00:04:06.808 --> 00:04:09.198
s'iz tsvishn Keshenev un Ades.

00:04:10.352 --> 00:04:12.793
hot men im arestirt, un m'hot genumen bay im

00:04:13.795 --> 00:04:16.345
monen gold, un m'hot im geshlogn.

00:04:16.345 --> 00:04:18.395
er iz geven naket un borves mitn kind

00:04:18.395 --> 00:04:22.575
hot men gemont gold. tsulib dem az er hot nisht vos tsu gibn, zol men merer shlogn.

00:04:22.575 --> 00:04:27.660
bay nakht hot zikh im ayngegebn tsu antloyfn mitn kind. s'iz geven a frost, a ⟨groys-⟩ tifer shney

00:04:27.717 --> 00:04:32.337
un avek fun d- fun di do- di zhandarm hobn getrunken geshikert.

00:04:32.337 --> 00:04:34.477
iz er aroysgelofn, iz er antlofn.

00:04:34.652 --> 00:04:40.065
ven zey hobn zikh oyfgekhapt in di fri, hobn zey gezen az er iz nishto, zenen nokhgelofn mit di ferd, mit a shlitn

00:04:40.065 --> 00:04:42.560
un m'hot im geshosn oyfn shney

00:04:42.735 --> 00:04:44.973
vi me shist lehavdl a hunt.

00:04:45.705 --> 00:04:49.732
im mitn kind fun akht yor. dos kind iz gevezn zeyer

00:04:49.941 --> 00:04:52.511
a talantful kind mit a

00:04:52.511 --> 00:04:53.785
mit a gutn

00:04:53.785 --> 00:04:55.456
muzikalishn EAR

00:04:55.456 --> 00:04:57.461
un vos er iz geven a fidler

00:04:58.902 --> 00:05:02.575
a ge- gen- UNK SLUKH hot er gehat ABSOLUTNO

00:05:02.631 --> 00:05:06.561
un mayn fot- mayn, d- mayn z- bruder iz alt geven in der tsayt

00:05:06.561 --> 00:05:08.331
finef zeks un draysik.

00:05:08.453 --> 00:05:10.590
dos kind iz alt geven akht yor.

00:05:10.782 --> 00:05:14.896
un vos hot ir getun nokh di milkhome, nokh ir zent tsurikgegangen?

00:05:14.896 --> 00:05:16.158
vos hot ir getun?

00:05:16.553 --> 00:05:17.983
vos ikh hob getun

00:05:17.983 --> 00:05:22.643
ikh bin geforn tsu mayn, geforn keyn Tshernovits, hob ikh oysgefunen

00:05:22.643 --> 00:05:24.703
az mayn bruder Zelik lebt.

00:05:25.024 --> 00:05:27.279
er hot gelebt in Lipkan

00:05:27.792 --> 00:05:30.384
der vos er iz geboyrn gevorn toyznt nayn hundert draytsn.

00:05:30.542 --> 00:05:32.665
er iz gevezn in lager.

00:05:32.665 --> 00:05:34.353
MOGIL- MOGILOV

00:05:34.353 --> 00:05:36.124
un iz gevezn in Yampele

00:05:36.124 --> 00:05:38.208
iz gevezn in Zhmerinke

00:05:38.208 --> 00:05:39.344
un andere lagers.

00:05:39.452 --> 00:05:42.368
VSYO. un de- er, er hot mir dertseylt

00:05:42.368 --> 00:05:45.168
ales vos iz forgekumen mit der mer- mamen

00:05:45.168 --> 00:05:49.198
hot men gefregt mit der mamen un mit di kinder, mit mayn bruder

00:05:49.198 --> 00:05:50.998
er hot aldings oysgefunen

00:05:50.998 --> 00:05:52.438
fun di lebn geblibene.

00:05:52.395 --> 00:05:55.400
vos hot ir getun nokh dem? ir ⟨zent⟩ UNK

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:57.553
nokh dem bin ikh avekgeforn keyn Tshernovits

00:05:57.728 --> 00:06:00.388
un hob mikh ayngeordnt arbetn.

00:06:00.495 --> 00:06:03.796
hob mikh ayngeordnt arbetn in a yesoymim hoyz.

00:06:04.748 --> 00:06:09.608
in a yesoymim hoyz, un ikh hob shtark getray gearbet. dortn geven yidishe kinder, un s'iz gevezn

00:06:09.608 --> 00:06:12.538
kristlekhe kinder, farshidene natsyonalitetn vos di k-

00:06:12.538 --> 00:06:14.978
di eltern zenen geharget gevorn oyfn front.

00:06:15.362 --> 00:06:18.832
un ikh hob avekgegibn dortn a sheyne etlekhe yorn mit mayn gezunt.

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:22.919
shpeter iz untergekumen a andere antisemitizm in Rusland

00:06:22.919 --> 00:06:25.577
vos m'hot ongehoybn ayntsuzetsn di doktoyrim

00:06:25.577 --> 00:06:27.281
az zey viln

00:06:27.281 --> 00:06:30.201
hargenen Stalinen mit aza min

00:06:30.201 --> 00:06:33.391
⟨in⟩ a groyser antisemitizm. m'hot ongehoybn tsu redn az me shikt aroys

00:06:33.391 --> 00:06:35.311
ale yidn keyn Birobidzhan.

00:06:35.173 --> 00:06:37.091
vo- velekhe yor iz dos geven?

00:06:37.317 --> 00:06:39.150
dos iz geven in di fuftsiker yorn.

00:06:40.725 --> 00:06:45.292
in di fuftsiker yorn befor Stalin iz geshtorbn. eyn un fuftsik, tsvey un fuftsik.

00:06:45.552 --> 00:06:49.748
un, un in onheyb dray un fuftsik. dray un fuftsik iz Stalin geshtorbn

00:06:50.226 --> 00:06:51.587
FORTUNATELY

00:06:51.711 --> 00:06:53.761
far der tsayt ⟨un⟩ vos

00:06:53.761 --> 00:06:55.901
hot men nisht aroysgeshikt di yidn

00:06:55.901 --> 00:06:58.069
un damolst bin ikh ibergangen oyf a andere arbet

00:06:58.069 --> 00:07:01.579
vayl in dem ge- in dem kinder hoyz

00:07:01.579 --> 00:07:03.909
iz gevezn a direktor

00:07:03.909 --> 00:07:06.929
velekher er iz gekumen funem RAYKOM, a komunist

00:07:06.929 --> 00:07:10.500
a komunist funem rayoner kom- k- komitet

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:13.069
un er hot, m'hot gehaltn

00:07:13.362 --> 00:07:16.168
a y- a, of- efntlekher eydes

00:07:16.168 --> 00:07:18.316
az di yidn zenen kosmopolitn.

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:22.484
ikh darf zitsn un hern vi ikh bin a kosmopolit.

00:07:22.727 --> 00:07:24.285
arbetn hob ikh gearbet

00:07:24.285 --> 00:07:26.158
nor m'hot onge- azoy hot men geheysn

00:07:26.158 --> 00:07:27.438
kosmopolitn

00:07:27.438 --> 00:07:30.858
un ikh hob mikh gevolt aroysraysn fun dortn, vayl dortn iz shoyn gevezn

00:07:30.858 --> 00:07:32.308
tsu eng far mir.

00:07:32.115 --> 00:07:33.571
iz vu zent ir gegangen?

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:37.706
bin ikh gegangen arbetn in a andere gesheft, in a groys gesheft, in a CLOTHING gesheft.

00:07:38.556 --> 00:07:42.662
un vu me makht, vi, POLUFABRIKAT heyst dos.

00:07:42.662 --> 00:07:44.577
a halbe fab- fabrik, a

00:07:44.577 --> 00:07:47.443
me kumt ahintsu tsu. me mest on

00:07:47.567 --> 00:07:51.375
di SUITS, un nokh dem farendikt men zey loyt ayer

00:07:51.685 --> 00:07:54.480
figur, loyt ayer

00:07:54.655 --> 00:07:59.475
ye, loyt ayer guf, loyt ayer far- figur.

00:07:59.987 --> 00:08:01.753
vos hot ir getun nokh dem?

00:08:02.299 --> 00:08:03.423
dortn

00:08:03.565 --> 00:08:06.742
iz ge- mayn direktor iz gevezn zeyer aktiv in

00:08:06.742 --> 00:08:08.691
in pr- in, in PROF-

00:08:08.691 --> 00:08:09.937
PROF- fareyn.

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:13.332
PROF- heyst PRO- PROFESYONALNIY f-

00:08:13.332 --> 00:08:15.253
ir veyst vos PROF- fareyn, azoy vi

00:08:15.259 --> 00:08:16.918
azoy vi di

00:08:16.918 --> 00:08:20.534
in, in NEW YORK di, di

00:08:22.347 --> 00:08:24.248
iz geven organizirt

00:08:25.047 --> 00:08:30.376
di, di arbetorers zenen geven organizirt, in SWEAT SHOPs, in, tsi vi azoy, iz geven organizirt.

00:08:29.406 --> 00:08:30.446
UNIONS?

00:08:30.376 --> 00:08:31.220
in UNION.

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:32.853
er iz gevezn in a UNION.

00:08:32.961 --> 00:08:37.084
un mir zenen gevezn oykh, ⟨hot men⟩ balangt tsun a UNION. der UNION hot gehat

00:08:37.084 --> 00:08:38.405
kontsertn

00:08:38.445 --> 00:08:39.451
klubn

00:08:39.727 --> 00:08:42.556
un s'iz UNK hot zikh getrofn vos s'iz gevezn

00:08:42.563 --> 00:08:44.261
a konkurs

00:08:44.352 --> 00:08:49.647
hot men gedarft delegirn, yede organizatsye hot gedarft delegirn oyb UNK vemen

00:08:49.647 --> 00:08:52.136
az me zol geyn ahintsu tsu zingen

00:08:52.136 --> 00:08:55.179
tantsn, oder andere talantn hot men gezukht

00:08:55.219 --> 00:08:56.681
in der filharmonye arayn.

00:08:57.396 --> 00:08:59.584
hot men gezukht talantn fun di

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:00.413
n-

00:09:00.413 --> 00:09:01.524
g- LOCAL

00:09:01.834 --> 00:09:03.307
merer

00:09:03.307 --> 00:09:04.258
kristn

00:09:04.467 --> 00:09:06.469
hutsuln, moldovanen

00:09:06.475 --> 00:09:07.920
or- ukrayner

00:09:07.977 --> 00:09:09.456
un rusishe

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:11.661
nor yidn zeyer veynik.

00:09:11.661 --> 00:09:13.556
oyb es iz shoyn geven a talant

00:09:13.933 --> 00:09:15.294
hot er mir geshikt

00:09:15.992 --> 00:09:18.534
er hot mir geshikt, un ikh hob ⟨im⟩ tsugegreyt

00:09:19.198 --> 00:09:21.431
in klub. profesor SHINDEROV

00:09:21.431 --> 00:09:23.664
un zayn froy, a profesorin SHINDEROV.

00:09:23.772 --> 00:09:26.432
hobn zey mir tsugegreyt mit etlekhe

00:09:26.522 --> 00:09:32.037
ARIAS un gezangen, un mayn repertuar iz geven ARIA CAVARADOSSI, der driter akt.

00:09:32.037 --> 00:09:34.937
ikh bin a dramatisher tenor mit a hoykhn RANGE

00:09:35.972 --> 00:09:37.046
CARMEN

00:09:37.845 --> 00:09:42.631
un, un, un PAGLIAZO, PAGLIACIO

00:09:42.975 --> 00:09:45.359
un ah

00:09:45.359 --> 00:09:47.964
a duet fun ANDREY I OKSANA

00:09:48.274 --> 00:09:50.563
mit nokh a zinger. kh'hob zeyer oysgenumen

00:09:51.497 --> 00:09:55.996
un UNEXPECTABLE hot mikh ayngeladn in der filharmonye.

00:09:56.256 --> 00:09:58.832
kh'hob gearbet in der filharmonye.

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:59.090
vi lang?

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:01.987
in der filharmonye hob ikh gearbet ariber dray yor

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:04.930
un mir ze'mir geforn iber ⟨CASTRON⟩

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:07.290
un dos iz zeyer a interesanter

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:09.490
peryod vos ikh darf mikh opshteln

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:10.860
a bisl oyf deroyf.

00:10:10.971 --> 00:10:16.398
es iz gevezn in, in toyznt nayn hundert, dray un fuftsik, fir un fuftsik

00:10:16.489 --> 00:10:18.086
iz gevezn a

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:25.021
a fareynikung tsvishn Ukraine un, un d- Rusland

00:10:25.568 --> 00:10:28.194
hot men gedarft bazingen

00:10:28.673 --> 00:10:32.027
di kemfers fun tsurik mit dray hundert yor

00:10:32.027 --> 00:10:35.129
velekhe zey gevorn di fareynikung, di brudershaft

00:10:35.136 --> 00:10:41.199
hobn zey oysgegrobn funem keyver fun dray hundert yor tsurik BOGDAN KHMELNYTSKY, dem groysn kozak

00:10:41.199 --> 00:10:44.411
vos er hot oysgeharget di ⟨shtet⟩ UNK gantse yidishe shtet.

00:10:44.687 --> 00:10:46.301
mir ho'mir gezungen

00:10:46.375 --> 00:10:48.430
ts- vegn zaynet vegn, eyn moment

00:10:48.430 --> 00:10:51.550
gezungen vegn zaynet vegn geloybts lider.

00:10:51.825 --> 00:10:57.804
hob ikh, mikh hot geekelt, hob ikh gezogt tsum CONDUCTOR "far vos zingt men ale leshoynes

00:10:57.804 --> 00:11:00.090
nor keyn eyn yidishe lid zingt men?"

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:04.174
hot er gezogt "BOGDAN KHMELNYTSKY hot nisht gehat tsu tun mit keyn zingen fun yidish"

00:11:04.174 --> 00:11:05.533
sarkastish

00:11:05.533 --> 00:11:07.665
un ikh hob gezukht ikh zol avekgeyn

00:11:07.722 --> 00:11:11.760
bin ikh antlofn, kh'hob dezertirt fun dem, fun ⟨di CASTRON⟩ aheym

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:15.320
hot men mikh gemishpet a khaverishn mishpet in der filharmonye

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.970
az ikh tor mer nit oyftretn oyf der STAGE.

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:20.321
ikh bin geven a soloist in BUKOVINSKIY

00:11:20.395 --> 00:11:25.823
b- ANSAMBL' TANTSY un UNK, zingen un tantsn.

00:11:25.795 --> 00:11:27.544
vos hot ir getun nokh dem?

00:11:27.837 --> 00:11:31.461
azoy vi m'hot mikh fun dortn, m'hot mir

