di shuln zenen geven, eyn shulekhl iz gevezn, hot men nisht gelozt dortn davenen

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:06.406
mikh bazunders

00:12:06.953 --> 00:12:09.377
OFITSYAL'NIY khazonim nisht gevezn

00:12:10.513 --> 00:12:13.190
hob ikh arumgeforn in minyonim

00:12:13.416 --> 00:12:18.135
fun shtot tsu shtot, fun dorf tsu dorf, vu es iz geven a yidishe kehile

00:12:18.158 --> 00:12:22.100
epes vos, hob ikh tsunoyfgenumen. yidn zenen gevezn shtark farinteresirt.

00:12:22.123 --> 00:12:25.948
ikh hob es nit getun nor tsulib mayn parnose, nor bay mir hot shoyn gebrent

