mayn tsienistisher ⟨oder⟩ vos ikh bin gevezn ertsoygn in yener tsayt.

00:12:29.553 --> 00:12:32.751
di yidn zenen geven shtark gaystik tsu hern a yidish vort

00:12:32.751 --> 00:12:34.672
