hob es getun

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:49.913
fun Tshernovits bin ikh geforn keyn Ades.

00:12:49.913 --> 00:12:52.132
fun Ades bin ikh geforn keyn Tashkent.

00:12:52.132 --> 00:12:54.419
in Tashkent muz ikh mikh opshteln

00:12:54.419 --> 00:12:55.532
a bisele

00:12:55.532 --> 00:12:56.241
vayl

00:12:56.241 --> 00:12:58.584
m'hot mikh aroysgerufn der K.G.B.

00:12:59.265 --> 00:13:01.506
m'hot mikh nisht gelozt. far vos bin ikh geforn?

00:13:01.506 --> 00:13:04.846
m'hot mir nokhgefolgt di K.G.B. m'hot mi- m'hot nisht erloybt.

00:13:04.846 --> 00:13:06.936
tsvey yor, fir yor oyf eyn plats.

00:13:06.936 --> 00:13:10.696
in Tashkent ven ikh bin ongekumen bin ikh geven APPOINTED a LEGAL khazn

00:13:10.696 --> 00:13:12.195
a registrirter.

00:13:12.195 --> 00:13:16.877
oyf a mol hot men mikh aroyfgerufn der K.G.B. un m'hot gezogt ikh zol nisht zingen azoy gut

00:13:17.338 --> 00:13:22.259
un m'hot mikh genumen oysfregn mayn gantse AVTOBIOGRAFYA, ver ikh bin, fun vanen ikh kum

00:13:22.671 --> 00:13:25.562
biz tsvelef a zeyger bay nakht. ikh makh es bekitser.

00:13:25.562 --> 00:13:27.508
iz arayngekumen der GENERAL

00:13:28.493 --> 00:13:31.271
der GENERAL. er hot gezogt "genug.

00:13:31.817 --> 00:13:36.755
mir veysn az m'hot aykh dortn ekspluatirt. veyn nit azoy shtark. mir veysn azoy du makhst gelt

00:13:37.065 --> 00:13:39.050
fun lebedike un fun andere

00:13:39.529 --> 00:13:43.539
kum, lomir aheymforn." tsvelef a zeyger hot er mikh genumen in zayn JEEP, un m'hot mikh opgefirt.

00:13:43.815 --> 00:13:45.297
in a tsayt arum

00:13:45.297 --> 00:13:49.305
iz geshen aza min fal vos in shtot hot men geharget a porfolk

00:13:49.305 --> 00:13:53.735
un s'iz geven a groyse levaye. dem, der b- zun, ⟨er iz, az er⟩ iz geven a groyser

00:13:53.735 --> 00:13:55.975
mentsh in der, in GOVERNMENT

00:13:55.975 --> 00:13:57.895
un ven s'hot zikh geendikt di levaye

00:13:57.895 --> 00:14:01.596
hob ikh mikh gelozt aheymgeyn. iz oyf a ⟨bergl⟩ geshtanen a hoykher man

00:14:01.618 --> 00:14:02.433
in a

00:14:02.433 --> 00:14:04.796
mantl, tsivil ongetun

00:14:04.796 --> 00:14:06.019
un ruft mikh tsu

00:14:06.019 --> 00:14:08.632
un fregt mikh "du host mikh, du derkenst mikh?"

00:14:08.892 --> 00:14:09.926
zog ikh "neyn."

00:14:09.926 --> 00:14:12.699
efnt er oyf der mantl, iz dos der GENERAL.

00:14:13.515 --> 00:14:15.039
do muz ikh mikh opshteln.

00:14:15.039 --> 00:14:16.457
der GENERAL. zog ikh

00:14:16.457 --> 00:14:17.967
"vos vilstu fun mir?"

00:14:17.967 --> 00:14:22.217
zogt er "ikh vil fun dir eyn toyve. keyner zol nit visn az mir hobn zikh do getrofn.

00:14:22.392 --> 00:14:23.595
mayn froy

00:14:23.595 --> 00:14:24.953
iz geshtorbn

00:14:24.953 --> 00:14:27.350
alt geven akht un fertsik yor

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:30.649
kh'hob zi shtark lib gehat. farn toyt hot zi mikh tsugerufn tsum

00:14:30.649 --> 00:14:32.038
tsum geleger un hot gezogt

00:14:32.584 --> 00:14:33.776
'BORIS'"

00:14:33.985 --> 00:14:36.645
a oysgetrakhter nomen. ikh vil nit onrufn zayn nomen.

00:14:36.651 --> 00:14:39.685
"'du veyst az ikh bin a yidishe, un ikh vil zayn

00:14:39.685 --> 00:14:42.220
az me, oyfn yidishn besoylem.

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:47.000
du bist a komunist, un ikh bin a ⟨komunistke⟩, ober ikh vil shoyn, ikh bin shoyn mer keyn komunist nit.

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:49.840
ikh vil azoy vi mayne eltern zenen

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:52.477
baerdikt gevorn in Kharkev, azoy vil ikh do.

00:14:52.477 --> 00:14:55.107
zolst mir opgibn dem koved oyfn yidishn din.

00:14:55.107 --> 00:14:59.392
ikh veys az du kenst dos nisht tun. du bist der GENERAL iber ale RELIGIONS

00:14:59.398 --> 00:15:01.336
iber ale uzbekishe

00:15:01.336 --> 00:15:04.219
TADZHIKISKIY un '" ⟨hot ir⟩.

00:15:04.444 --> 00:15:06.294
TAK. hob ikh ge-

00:15:07.819 --> 00:15:08.963
⟨ot⟩. "vos vilstu?"

00:15:08.963 --> 00:15:11.433
hot er mikh tsugerufn tsum keyver fun zayn froy

00:15:11.433 --> 00:15:13.353
az ikh zol makhn di SERVICES.

00:15:13.353 --> 00:15:15.933
gemakht el mole rakhmim, nokh etlekhe tfiles

00:15:15.933 --> 00:15:17.905
iz er anidergefaln oyf der erd

00:15:17.927 --> 00:15:20.587
mit di knis un hot gekusht di erd un hot geveynt

00:15:20.593 --> 00:15:22.696
un iz gevorn mit mir bafrayndet.

00:15:22.905 --> 00:15:24.032
durkh im

00:15:24.032 --> 00:15:26.392
hot, bin ikh geratevet gevorn

00:15:26.432 --> 00:15:29.576
vayl shpeter hot men mikh gevolt arestirn

00:15:29.576 --> 00:15:30.816
derfar vos

00:15:30.816 --> 00:15:32.501
m'hot zikh gedarft fun mir

00:15:33.132 --> 00:15:34.425
poter vern

00:15:34.566 --> 00:15:36.876
hot er mikh bagegnt bay tramvay

00:15:36.876 --> 00:15:38.886
hot er ⟨bage-⟩ zogt er "for aroys."

00:15:38.886 --> 00:15:39.777
iz aroys

00:15:39.777 --> 00:15:43.234
an artikl in der, in di tsaytungen AGAINST mir

00:15:43.442 --> 00:15:44.668
az ikh makh

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:47.610
propagande un azoy vayter, un ikh

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:49.800
tor mer nit zayn, ikh bin a tsienist

00:15:50.074 --> 00:15:54.556
hot er mir gezogt "for aroys." bin ikh aroysgeforn fun dortn keyn TIFLIS, Gruzye.

00:15:55.103 --> 00:15:56.126
GEORGIA.

00:15:55.137 --> 00:15:56.886
vos far yor iz dos geven?

00:15:56.655 --> 00:15:59.467
dos iz gevezn in di, in zekhtsiker yorn.

00:15:59.929 --> 00:16:02.015
fun vanet zent ir gegangen

00:16:02.325 --> 00:16:03.821
fun UNK?

00:16:02.747 --> 00:16:05.309
fun TASHKENT bin ikh gegangen keyn Gruzye.

00:16:05.309 --> 00:16:10.321
in Gruzye, GEORGIA, iz gevezn erloybt. dortn zenen do ⟨CHACHAMIM⟩ gruzinishe yidn

00:16:10.321 --> 00:16:12.461
iz geven erloybt beser di religye.

00:16:13.243 --> 00:16:15.312
un fun zekhtsik biz

00:16:15.387 --> 00:16:19.997
fun zekhtsik biz eyn un zibetsik bin ikh geven khazn. ikh hob gearbet bay der

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:16.646
vi lang UNK

00:16:19.997 --> 00:16:21.947
melukhe, a andere

00:16:21.947 --> 00:16:24.966
may- mayn profesye oykhet. andersh hot men nisht erloybt.

00:16:25.208 --> 00:16:28.425
un fun nayntsn nayn un zibetsik, vos hot ir getun?

00:16:27.317 --> 00:16:31.617
nayntsn eyn un zibetsik, ven mayn zun iz gevorn bar mitsve

00:16:31.617 --> 00:16:33.217
in T- in TIBLIS

00:16:33.217 --> 00:16:35.347
iz er geven der ershter bar mitsve

00:16:35.347 --> 00:16:40.776
hot mikh aroysgerufn di K.G.B. m'hot gezogt "s'iz nisht erloybt er zol hobn bar mitsve. dos iz nokhn akhtsntn yor

00:16:40.776 --> 00:16:43.116
iz keyn mol nit geven keyn bar mitsve in der shul

00:16:43.116 --> 00:16:44.936
un di host zikh ayngeshtelt."

00:16:44.968 --> 00:16:47.656
hob ikh gezogt az ikh bin a yid

00:16:47.656 --> 00:16:50.162
ikh hob gehat bar mitsve. kh'hob nisht gevust az s'iz nisht erloybt.

00:16:50.162 --> 00:16:51.172
aher, ahin

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:53.749
mir zenen, s'hot zikh mir ayngegibn

00:16:53.749 --> 00:16:57.359
az mir zoln aroysforn ALIYA makhn keyn Yisroel

00:16:57.359 --> 00:17:01.699
durkh dem vos akhtsn gruziner hot men ayngegibn a BAKASHA tsu der UNO

00:17:01.699 --> 00:17:04.031
un m'hot, zey hobn oyfgeefnt di toyern

00:17:04.031 --> 00:17:08.641
un ikh bin arayngefaln tsvishn zey, un ikh bin oyle geven in eyn un zibetsikstn yor

00:17:08.641 --> 00:17:09.667
keyn Yisroel.

00:17:10.045 --> 00:17:11.400
un fun

00:17:10.489 --> 00:17:11.442
may.

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:13.526
un fun eyn un zibetsik

00:17:11.442 --> 00:17:12.789
zibetsn may.

00:17:13.526 --> 00:17:17.024
zent ir gelebt, hot ir gelebt in Yisroel biz ven?

00:17:16.676 --> 00:17:22.082
fun eyn un zibetsikstn yor, ikh bin ongekumen. hot mikh teykef, hob ikh gegibn probe

00:17:22.082 --> 00:17:23.862
gegibn AUDITIONS

00:17:23.862 --> 00:17:26.762
in di greste shuln, un m'hot mikh APPOINTED in

00:17:26.762 --> 00:17:30.162
in SUBURB UNK Tel Aviv un CHOLON, in di groyse shuln, di groys-

00:17:30.162 --> 00:17:33.354
di, un, un shpeter hob ikh, bin ikh geven in der grester shul

00:17:33.354 --> 00:17:35.616
oyf ALLENBY hundert mit tsen

00:17:35.616 --> 00:17:37.227
V- in Tel Aviv

00:17:37.227 --> 00:17:40.953
ales UNK

00:17:40.774 --> 00:17:45.476
un ven, vi lang hot ir gevoynt in Tel Aviv? un dernokh dem?

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:44.362
tsvey yor.

00:17:45.432 --> 00:17:47.850
un dernokh dem zenen gekumen turistn

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:51.855
un zey hobn gebrakht zibn seyfer toyres fun UNK CANADA un fun Amerike

00:17:51.878 --> 00:17:53.829
vegn di naye OLIM

00:17:53.835 --> 00:17:57.747
un mikh hot men ayngeladn az ikh zol makhn di tseremonye in T- in, in

00:17:57.747 --> 00:18:00.917
in, in JERUSALEM mit mayn yingele.

00:18:00.917 --> 00:18:05.517
mayn yingele iz Shmuel, hot oykhet gezungen bay mir in CHOIR un hot gezungen SOLO NUMBER.

00:18:05.517 --> 00:18:08.178
kh'hob shtark oysgenumen unter der khupe

00:18:08.178 --> 00:18:11.678
⟨mit⟩ di zibn seyfer toyres, un ikh hob, ikh hob gekent dem repertuar

00:18:11.678 --> 00:18:16.343
un s'iz do PICTURES vu ikh bin fotografirt. s'iz geven ibern gantsn land fun Yisroel

00:18:16.343 --> 00:18:19.361
ale korespondentn, nisht tsulib mir

00:18:19.401 --> 00:18:21.131
dos hot men getun tsulib dem

00:18:21.131 --> 00:18:24.901
vos s'iz gevezn di groyse delegatsye fun Amerike un fun CANADA.

00:18:24.901 --> 00:18:27.191
ale zenen zey geven mizrekhistn, fun dem

00:18:27.191 --> 00:18:28.801
zey hobn balangt tsu der MIZRACHI

00:18:28.801 --> 00:18:29.590
MIFLAGA.

00:18:29.590 --> 00:18:30.465
PARTY.

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:33.520
un d- fun ⟨in⟩ CANADA, der, der, der

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:37.400
PRESIDENT fun der MIZRACHIsher organizatsye hot mikh ayngeladn keyn CANADA

00:18:37.795 --> 00:18:39.426
ikh zol kumen oyf a TOUR

00:18:39.634 --> 00:18:41.546
hob ikh gezogt "ikh hob nisht keyn vize"

00:18:41.546 --> 00:18:43.343
hot er mir aroysgeshikt a vize.

00:18:43.343 --> 00:18:44.896
hob ikh gezogt "kh'hob nit keyn gelt"

00:18:44.896 --> 00:18:47.967
hot mir aroysgeshikt gelt. bin gekumen ahintsu tsu

00:18:47.967 --> 00:18:49.112
keyn NEW YORK

00:18:50.147 --> 00:18:54.599
hob ikh nisht gekont azoy gikher forn, derfar vos ikh hob gehat a kontrakt in der groyser shul

00:18:54.599 --> 00:18:56.058
iz der rov

00:18:56.058 --> 00:18:59.417
un der, ar-, der PRESIDENT CHETZRONI

00:18:59.417 --> 00:19:01.247
olevasholem, zikhroyne levrokhe

00:19:01.247 --> 00:19:06.047
er hot gezogt "ven du zolst zayn a anderer khazn, volt ikh dokh dir geven opgelozt, nor azoy vi du host aza min sheyne VOICE

00:19:06.047 --> 00:19:08.937
vestu dervaremen di hertser funem yidishn folk in Yi-

00:19:08.937 --> 00:19:12.095
in Amerike, un zey veln oyfefenen zeyere keshenes, un veln gibn

00:19:12.095 --> 00:19:13.581
tsdoke oyf Erets Yisroel.

00:19:13.603 --> 00:19:17.650
zolstu forn." azoy hot er mir ongeshribn, ⟨ober⟩ ikh bin biz haynt tsu tog der UNK

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:22.676
un ikh bin avekgeforn keyn, keyn NEW YORK. in NEW YORK hot mikh bagegnt a MANAGER

00:19:22.783 --> 00:19:26.256
un hot gebrakht tsvey khazonim UNK vos er zol gibn

00:19:26.256 --> 00:19:27.126
probe

00:19:27.126 --> 00:19:31.536
un m'hot shoyn ongeklungen keyn COLUMBUS, OHIO, zenen gekumen di prezidentn

00:19:31.536 --> 00:19:33.436
un m'hot mikh tsugenumen ales

00:19:34.022 --> 00:19:35.518
ales CANTOR

00:19:35.592 --> 00:19:36.834
far, bin ikh

00:19:37.566 --> 00:19:39.635
geblibn oyf tsvey yor

00:19:40.165 --> 00:19:42.032
in COLUMBUS, OHIO

00:19:43.253 --> 00:19:47.449
un dernokh dem hot men farlengert dem kontrakt. ikh bin geven dortn zibn yor.

00:19:47.455 --> 00:19:49.502
m'hot mikh PROVIDED a HOUSE

00:19:49.502 --> 00:19:51.029
un a gute SALARY

00:19:51.029 --> 00:19:52.839
un dem ershtn yomkiper

00:19:52.839 --> 00:19:56.069
hot men gebetn azoy ikh zol aroystretn mitn JEWISH APPEAL.

00:19:56.069 --> 00:19:57.880
ikh hob geredt tsen minut

00:19:57.880 --> 00:20:01.365
oyf yidish, un di iberike geven a redner fun JEWISH APPEAL

00:20:01.365 --> 00:20:03.516
un m'hot gemakht a fertl milyon DOLLAR

00:20:03.516 --> 00:20:04.560
oyf Yisroel.

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:06.790
kh'hob dokumentn oyf deroyf.

00:20:07.755 --> 00:20:09.230
ikh vil aykh

00:20:09.230 --> 00:20:12.380
fregn eyder mir farendikn dem intervyu

00:20:12.227 --> 00:20:12.862
yo

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:14.910
tsi ir hot nokh epes vos ir vilt

00:20:14.910 --> 00:20:15.882
zogn.

00:20:16.716 --> 00:20:19.258
yo. ikh hob nokh epes vos ikh vil zogn

00:20:19.602 --> 00:20:21.553
vegn mayn bruder

00:20:21.694 --> 00:20:24.000
un vegn mayn shvegerin Zlate

00:20:26.301 --> 00:20:28.877
un vegn mayn bruder BORIS.

00:20:29.423 --> 00:20:32.813
mayn bruder BORIS, azoy vi gezogt oyvn hot men avekgeshikt

00:20:32.813 --> 00:20:36.653
keyn, keyn, keyn PECHORA, un dortn iz er opgeven akht yor

00:20:36.662 --> 00:20:37.820
un iz

00:20:38.788 --> 00:20:40.778
UNK akht yor in tfise

00:20:40.778 --> 00:20:44.318
un dernokh dem hot men aroysgelozt oyf der fray, un m'hot im nisht aheymgelozt.

00:20:44.475 --> 00:20:46.156
er iz aheymgekumen shoyn

00:20:47.023 --> 00:20:47.914
a

00:20:47.914 --> 00:20:53.357
a tse- tsebrokhener. tsebrokhn di FAMILY, tsebrokhn. zayn vayb iz geven in a lager

00:20:53.357 --> 00:20:55.438
shoyn mer nisht getrofn, un azoy vayter.

00:20:55.697 --> 00:20:59.825
un der bruder iz er, iz aheymgekumen, un shpeter

00:20:59.865 --> 00:21:02.458
hot er, iz er geshtorbn in NATSERET.

00:21:02.464 --> 00:21:05.327
er iz opgeforn keyn Yisroel un iz geshtorbn in NATSERET.

00:21:05.333 --> 00:21:06.930
mayn bruder Zelik

00:21:07.054 --> 00:21:08.916
iz aheymgekumen tsebrokhn

00:21:08.916 --> 00:21:10.147
fun di lagern

00:21:10.147 --> 00:21:14.678
un iz, un krank, un iz geshtorbn bay akht un fertsik yor alt

00:21:14.678 --> 00:21:17.156
iz geshtorbn in Tshernovits zeyer krank

00:21:17.213 --> 00:21:20.011
mit a groysn revmatizm in di, in di beyner

00:21:20.011 --> 00:21:22.701
⟨vos⟩ fun di lagern, iz er geshtorbn dort

00:21:22.701 --> 00:21:26.011
un zayn tekhterl iz oykhet geshtorbn in Tshernovits.

00:21:26.663 --> 00:21:29.239
dos iberike vos ikh volt gevolt zogn

00:21:30.477 --> 00:21:32.136
az ikh aleyn

00:21:32.136 --> 00:21:33.013
fun

00:21:33.013 --> 00:21:34.419
fun

00:21:34.628 --> 00:21:37.586
